WEBVTT

00:08:27.321 --> 00:08:42.820
(Piano)

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:46.692
♪ I would be a beauty ♪
(Aku ingin menjadi cantik)

00:08:46.692 --> 00:08:50.168
♪ but my nose ♪ 
(tapi hidungku)

00:08:50.168 --> 00:08:53.802
♪ is slightly too big ♪ 
(terlalu besar)

00:08:53.802 --> 00:08:57.300
♪ for my face ♪ 
(di wajahku)

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.175
♪ And I would be a dreamer ♪ 
(dan aku ingin bermimpi)